flowchart TD
  A[Authorized User Upload] --> B[Validate size, extension, MIME]
  B --> C[Malware Scan]
  C --> D{Safe?}
  D -->|No| E[Quarantine / reject]
  D -->|Yes| F[Private Object Storage]
  F --> G[Extract text and tables]
  G --> H[Normalize and chunk]
  H --> I[Attach tenant and ACL metadata]
  I --> J[Generate embeddings]
  J --> K[Store chunks and vectors]
  K --> L[Retrieval quality checks]
  L --> M{Pass?}
  M -->|Yes| N[Activate index generation]
  M -->|No| O[Failed state / review]
